[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 5831.91, "timestamp": "01:37:11", "text": "これ？待って、これは何？ 20まで行くよ"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 5832.199, "timestamp": "01:37:12", "author": "@LordHeadAss002", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/-EWTr8l_W5L2rvpeIbbmfhhB0C_JFG5p8g68fFdW2VO7paKednRMpYHY2A7J0gqpYJkgYp2Vnw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "so the MC in silver palace is called the detective"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5833.43, "timestamp": "01:37:13", "text": "ノット前進。そして私がやりたいことは"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5835.59, "timestamp": "01:37:15", "text": "次のジャンプを加速させる。そして私は好きです"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5837.51, "timestamp": "01:37:17", "text": "できるだけ早くそれを実行するために"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5839.43, "timestamp": "01:37:19", "text": "次のやつ。そして、徐々にその段階に持っていくつもりだ。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5841.51, "timestamp": "01:37:21", "text": "もっと速く、もっと速く、もっと速く。自分を"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5843.83, "timestamp": "01:37:23", "text": "最悪のシナリオに陥る。そして、その速さは"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5846.07, "timestamp": "01:37:26", "text": "私が回復するまでどれくらい時間がかかりますか？"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 5847.077, "timestamp": "01:37:27", "author": "@LordHeadAss002", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/-EWTr8l_W5L2rvpeIbbmfhhB0C_JFG5p8g68fFdW2VO7paKednRMpYHY2A7J0gqpYJkgYp2Vnw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "so im assuming we get to do interrogations"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5849.35, "timestamp": "01:37:29", "text": "これらのケースはすべて回復可能です。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5852.149, "timestamp": "01:37:32", "text": "では、これを着けてください。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5853.669, "timestamp": "01:37:33", "text": "フレームをもう一度確認してみましょう。うん、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5855.35, "timestamp": "01:37:35", "text": "これが私の手の位置です。あなたの手"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5857.43, "timestamp": "01:37:37", "text": "ポジションは良い。はい、どうぞ。あなたはできる"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5859.91, "timestamp": "01:37:39", "text": "俺は自分でスタントをやるんだよ。ただ知っておいてほしいのは、私は"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5862.47, "timestamp": "01:37:42", "text": "きもい。私の頭はこうなるだろう"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5864.709, "timestamp": "01:37:44", "text": "これ。それでいい。それはあなたに多くのものを与えてくれます"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5866.669, "timestamp": "01:37:46", "text": "より多くの誤差許容範囲。話しましょう"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5869.27, "timestamp": "01:37:49", "text": "安全性。同じように退出してください。私は"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5870.79, "timestamp": "01:37:50", "text": "加速スピン。本当に、私たちは"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5872.07, "timestamp": "01:37:52", "text": "このフレームの中に何を見たいですか？私たちは"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5874.709, "timestamp": "01:37:54", "text": "私が倒れるのを見て、それから私はそれを投げ捨てる。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5877.75, "timestamp": "01:37:57", "text": "ああ、わかりました。さあ、みんな、やろうぜ。何歳ですか"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5879.87, "timestamp": "01:37:59", "text": "トム"}]